      "comment" : "Explains the Focus on Faces switch. Must not say that it turns face detection off: it decides only whether autofocus and auto exposure follow faces. No default note. Draft wording for the Honesty review (docs/design/BUILD-SPEC.md, section 5). Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
