    "Distortion correction stayed on for this lens." : {
      "comment" : "What's in This Photo, processing section: the lens kept the camera's geometric distortion correction on for this photo. Shown only where a device test showed it. Must not claim more than the English. Draft wording for the Honesty review (docs/design/BUILD-SPEC.md, section 5). Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "En este objetivo, la corrección de distorsión siguió activada."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "En este lente, la corrección de distorsión siguió activada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Distortion correction stays on for this lens, even though nope. asks for it to be off." : {
      "comment" : "Processing note of a lens that can't save RAW, shown only where a device test showed that this lens keeps the camera's geometric distortion correction on. Must not claim more than the English. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged. Draft wording for the Honesty review (docs/design/BUILD-SPEC.md, section 5). Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "En este objetivo, la corrección de distorsión sigue activada aunque nope. pide desactivarla."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "En este lente, la corrección de distorsión sigue activada aunque nope. pide desactivarla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Distortion correction: this lens doesn't let apps turn it off or report whether it's used, so its photos may be corrected for lens distortion." : {
      "comment" : "Processing note and photo details: the lens offers no switch for the camera's geometric distortion correction, which reshapes the picture. Keep \"may\": it isn't known whether the correction is applied. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Corrección de distorsión: este objetivo no permite que las apps la desactiven ni indica si se usa, así que sus fotos pueden tener corregida la distorsión del objetivo."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Corrección de distorsión: este lente no permite que las apps la desactiven ni indica si se usa, así que sus fotos pueden tener corregida la distorsión del lente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Distortion correction: this lens lets apps turn it off, and nope. does." : {
