    "nope. asks the camera to put speed before quality, and turns off what apps can: Apple ProRAW, zero shutter lag, responsive capture, deferred processing, constant color, content-aware distortion correction and digital zoom." : {
      "comment" : "Processing note of a lens without RAW: the camera features the app turns off. Apple ProRAW is Apple's name. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged. Must not claim more than the English. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "nope. pide a la cámara que priorice la velocidad sobre la calidad y desactiva lo que las apps pueden desactivar: Apple ProRAW, retardo cero del obturador, captura con respuesta rápida, procesamiento diferido, color constante, corrección de distorsión según el contenido y zoom digital."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
