    },
    "Photos aren't signed unless you turn on Sign Each Photo in nope.'s settings. A signed photo lets anyone check that it hasn't changed since nope. saved it, and shows that it was taken with nope. and which version. It doesn't identify you or your device." : {
      "comment" : "Issue #80; docs/PRIVACY.md, \"Content Credentials\". Sign Each Photo is the name of nope.'s own switch; use its translation. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged. Must not claim more than the English. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Las fotos no se firman a menos que actives «Firmar cada foto» en los ajustes de nope. Una foto firmada permite a cualquiera comprobar que no ha cambiado desde que nope. la guardó, y muestra que se tomó con nope. y con qué versión. No te identifica a ti ni a tu dispositivo."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
