    "The phone's camera makes this photo: it turns the sensor data into a finished image, choosing its colors and tone and any noise reduction and sharpening, and compresses it as %@. Apps can't turn these steps off." : {
      "comment" : "Processing note of a lens without RAW. The placeholder is a file format name, HEIF or JPEG. Must not claim more than the English: it says what the phone may apply, not that it applies each step. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
